      "body": "> \ud83e\udd16 SPARQ agent \u2014 crates/sparq-shacl/src/eval.rs (cmp_literals/timestamp) now reimplements the mixed-timezone-presence \u00b114h determinate-window comparison that already exists as sparq_core::temporal::Timeline/cmp_instants (used by the engine's FILTER/ORDER BY path). The two implementations agree today (both treat exactly-14h as indeterminate, strict > 14h as decidable) but can drift. Consider routing sparq-shacl's dateTime/date comparison through sparq_core::temporal, or adding a differential unit test pinning parity between the two.\n\n> \ud83e\udd16 Discovered by the SPARQ worker while implementing #3407. Out-of-scope for that PR; captured as follow-up.\n<!-- sparq-followup:v1 -->",
