      "body": "Per-profile sub-epic of sq-pbz04 (program parent: sq-6tykl). BUILT: D-entailment ships as Profile::D inside sparq-reason behind the d-entail feature (dtype.rs: rdfD1 typing + typed value-space compare), wired into the conformance entailment harness (inference/entail.rs, cfg d-entail). REMAINING: (a) migrate dtype.rs's typed value-space comparison onto the substrate value-space comparator once sq-v5evr lands \u2014 D-entailment is the concrete second consumer whose existence un-parks that carve-out (seam 2); acceptance = differential parity with the engine's value semantics over the XSD matrix, entailment ratchet unchanged; (b) broaden the recognised-datatype map with honest fail-closed handling of unsupported datatypes; (c) interaction with named-graph entailment is tracked separately (sq-6qpyf, sq-oy1f.21) \u2014 do not duplicate. Opt-in feature throughout. \ud83e\udd16 SPARQ agent [FABLE-5]\n\n<!-- bd-id:sq-pbz04.6 -->\nParent: #2608\n",
